⭐ SSA Bill of Rights

Developers have the right to define their own build boundaries.
Developers have the right to override automation at every layer.
Developers have the right to semantic truth authored by humans.
Developers have the right to deterministic static output.
Developers have the right to human‑governed validation gates.
Developers have the right to reject agentic instability.
Developers have the right to architectural sovereignty.
Developers have the right to transparency in metadata generation.
Developers have the right to manual canonicalization.
Developers have the right to protect their craft from corporate automation.
Signed,

Galen W. Tenney

Founding Architect of the Sovereign SEO Architecture (SSA)

